{"id":"invisible","lemma":"invisible","pos":"adj","rank":2479,"glosses":["invisible (unable to be seen)","invisible (not appearing on the surface)"],"ipa":"/ɛ̃.vi.zibl/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/09/Fr-invisible.ogg/Fr-invisible.ogg.mp3","forms":{"plural":"invisibles"},"formAudio":{"invisibles":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/22/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-invisibles.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Ce sera invisible.","en":"It'll be invisible.","words":[{"g":"this / it"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},null]},{"text":"L'air est invisible.","en":"Air is invisible.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"air"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},null]},{"text":"L'air est un mélange de gaz invisibles.","en":"Air is a mixture of invisible gases.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"air"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"mixture, blend"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"gas"},null]},{"text":"Au milieu de la neige le lapin blanc était invisible.","en":"Against the snow, the white rabbit was invisible.","words":[null,null,null,{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"snow"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"rabbit"},{"g":"white"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},null],"phrases":[[0,3,"in the middle of"]]},{"text":"Les bactéries sont invisibles à l'œil nu.","en":"Bacteria are invisible to the naked eye.","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"bacterium","l":"bactérie"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},null,{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"eye"},{"g":"naked"}]}]}